  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  buttonText:
    fi: "\nUlpukka\n\nUlpukalla on leve\xE4t kelluvat lehdet ja keltaiset kukat.
      Se kasvaa monenlaisissa vesiss\xE4 ja sen lehdet kest\xE4v\xE4t paremmin virtausta
      kuin lumpeen lehdet."
    sw: "\nGul n\xE4ckrose\n\nGul n\xE4ckrosen har breda, flytande blad och gula
      blommor. Den v\xE4xer i m\xE5nga olika typer av vatten och dess blad t\xE5l
      str\xF6mmar b\xE4ttre \xE4n vit n\xE4ckrosens blad."
    en: '

      Yellow water-lily


      The yellow water-lily has broad, floating
      leaves and yellow flowers. It grows in many types of water, and its leaves
      are more resistant to currents than those of the white water-lily.'
